ariadne (the Meadow package) is a port of the Rust crate ariadne
(https://github.com/zesterer/ariadne), version 0.6.0, by Joshua Barretto and
contributors, to Meadow. It paints text as yansi 1.0.1
(https://github.com/SergioBenitez/yansi), by Sergio Benitez, does. Its test
cases are generated from those crates, and its code is translated from their
source.

ariadne is licensed under the MIT license, and so is this port: see LICENSE
(ariadne's). yansi is licensed under the MIT or Apache-2.0 licenses, and the
part of it this port follows is used under the MIT license: see LICENSE-yansi.
